    "body": "> I think probably it should be `display: block` by default all of the time (rather than only when it's hidden).\r\n\r\nIn all my experiments ([here](https://codepen.io/bramus/pen/ZEPzzJq), [here](https://codepen.io/bramus/pen/LYaPPGK), and [here](https://codepen.io/bramus/pen/bGZbGZP)) I have done this, so +1 on using `display: block` by default.",
